{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/03d01f61e6b2ca7ab507873656d82a8e.poster.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/03d01f61e6b2ca7ab507873656d82a8e.webm?t=1768912276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTAMINANT</strong> is a third-person, story-driven survival adventure set in an alternate post-Soviet reality, where complex battles, mind-bending puzzles, and hauntingly surrealistic atmospheres collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/4892e0ea9d8e407503337d1c3c04e2dd.poster.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/4892e0ea9d8e407503337d1c3c04e2dd.webm?t=1768912276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the tragic shoes of Maria, the beloved granddaughter of the factory owner, as you look for clues about your grandfather\u2019s fate inside his haunting, metallic legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/bea4eff884e32a2f2b2c4ffe7634aaf1.poster.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/bea4eff884e32a2f2b2c4ffe7634aaf1.webm?t=1768912276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where reality bends, silence whispers, and every shadow hides a secret. Curiosity is your only guide - just don\u2019t expect all doors to lead back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/032ec829002be2dfdaa636bb79aae6cd.poster.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/032ec829002be2dfdaa636bb79aae6cd.webm?t=1768912276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seemed familiar might not be real at all. Make your way through surreal areas constantly bent by illusions of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/41b8032e4281c8bc2b4108d769ebc8c5.poster.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/41b8032e4281c8bc2b4108d769ebc8c5.webm?t=1768912276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world before you defies logic, puzzles might need more than just the knack for them. Solve complex riddles brought upon by the world\u2019s distorted simulacrum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/4cb1c45bdc1254db49bea0219630d02c.poster.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/4cb1c45bdc1254db49bea0219630d02c.webm?t=1768912276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans\u2019 flirtation with reality has set free the abominations of the mind, in the form of unspeakable creatures. Take part in engaging yet haunting battles as you fight for survival\u2019s sake.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668880?t=1768912276","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/3f4187a2d6a72dc5f4048be2155f9569c3d35835/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768912276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/de6c787dabeaa0c28a9c3b09e44522f1e107d7b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768912276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/de6c787dabeaa0c28a9c3b09e44522f1e107d7b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768912276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work: Scenes of violence or cruelty, Adult Content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/70f33d8d5442d47d03dd0e51d53c5cbb.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668880/extras/03d01f61e6b2ca7ab507873656d82a8e.poster.avif?t=1768912276\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets